# Mark vendored upstream sources so GitHub treats them as what they are.
#
# `linguist-vendored` keeps them out of the repository's language statistics
# and collapses them by default in pull-request diffs. Without it the language
# bar reads mostly C — roughly 376,000 lines of FreeType, libpng, zlib, and
# HarfBuzz against SonicTerm's own 117,000 lines of Rust — which describes
# what the project builds rather than what it is.
crates/sonicterm-freetype/freetype2/** linguist-vendored
crates/sonicterm-freetype/libpng/**    linguist-vendored
crates/sonicterm-freetype/zlib/**      linguist-vendored
crates/sonicterm-harfbuzz/harfbuzz/**  linguist-vendored
